    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Social Policy Development Centre (SPDC) in collaboration with The Aga Khan University's Institute [or Educational Development (AKU-IED) is organizing an 'intensive workshop on participatory research methods titled \"Qualitative Research: Life Beyond Numbers.\" Dr Hafiz Pasha, the Managing Director, SPDC, made the opening remarks following a welcome address by Dr Robert Baker, Director, AKU-lED. The workshop is being conducted at AKU-IED in Karimabad, Karachi, by Colin Stewart, a consultant on social policy from Ottawa, Canada. The workshop started on December 9, 1999, and will continue till May next year.",
